  "description": "A pluggable persistence layer for SetNet module state: IDocumentStore<T> (get/set/remove/enumerate by key) and ISnapshotStore (opaque byte blobs) with in-memory and JSON-file implementations out of the box. Back your inventories, wallets, progression, save-games or world snapshots with something durable instead of in-process dictionaries — then swap in a Redis/DB store behind the same interface. Depends on SetNet + System.Text.Json.",
